    "synthesis_rationale": "The posterior of 0.98 arises from a strong positive update due to an already-high early-2026 pace, moderated by credible countervailing forces (policy/SAR, reporting gaps). The factors are plausibly correlated (e.g., high pace may accompany weather-driven spikes), so updates were treated as jointly informative but not strictly additive. Calibration reflects a high-confidence interim forecast conditioned on continued near-term data flow and no abrupt regime shift."
  }
}

